tch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> (cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (candidate ultrafilter base)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (candidate nonprincipal ultrafilter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S\\)</span> (base predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UltrafilterNumber}\">\\(\\operatorname{UltrafilterNumber}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 为类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,\\omega)\\land\\mathcal U\\cap[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,\\omega)\\land\\mathcal U\\cap[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\operatorname{UltrafilterNumber}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land \\kappa=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\exists\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal U)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\operatorname{UltrafilterNumber}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land \\kappa=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\exists\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\operatorname{NonprincipalUltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal U)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimum ranges over bases of nonprincipal ultrafilters on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]",